@startuml plugins
' Rendered with PlantUML, smetana layout (no Graphviz needed).
!pragma layout smetana

skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #FFFFFF
  FontSize 15
}
<style>
rectangle {
  MinimumWidth 230
}
</style>

title Plugins\n<size:12><color:#777>Les plugins</color></size>

rectangle "**Plugin**\n<size:11><color:#777>Plugin</color></size>\nOne installable unit: skills, subagents, hooks, MCP server configs and more\n<size:11><color:#777>Une unité installable : skills, sous-agents, hooks, configurations de serveurs MCP et plus encore</color></size>\nRead before you install: it runs code with your privileges\n<size:11><color:#777>Lisez avant d'installer : il exécute du code avec vos privilèges</color></size>\nIts components run alongside yours: its hooks stack with yours\n<size:11><color:#777>Ses composants s'exécutent à côté des vôtres : ses hooks s'additionnent aux vôtres</color></size>" as PG #CFCBDD
rectangle "**Marketplace**\n<size:11><color:#777>Marketplace</color></size>\nA shared source that plugins resolve through\n<size:11><color:#777>Une source partagée via laquelle les plugins sont résolus</color></size>\nListed isn't the same as trusted\n<size:11><color:#777>Être référencé ne veut pas dire être digne de confiance</color></size>" as MK #E8E2D0
rectangle "**Manifest**\n<size:11><color:#777>Manifeste</color></size>\nOptional, at .claude-plugin/plugin.json: components are found by convention\n<size:11><color:#777>Facultatif, dans .claude-plugin/plugin.json : les composants sont trouvés par convention</color></size>\nName, the only required field, namespaces the skills: /plugin-name:skill-name\n<size:11><color:#777>Le nom, seul champ obligatoire, préfixe les skills : /plugin-name:skill-name</color></size>" as MF #E8E2D0

' Lesson 9: a plugin's two sides, using one (a marketplace, read before you install) and packaging one (the manifest).
PG --> MK
PG --> MF

@enduml
